      },
      "text":"In the same test, the tool call failure rate dropped by 11% across all Computer activity, and by about 7% excluding the system's own background runs.\n\nMedium- and high-dissatisfaction threads per user dropped by 7.6%. Cost and response time didn't measurably change."
