      },
      "text":"Autonomous skill configuration removes friction and improves results.\n\nIn an 8-week randomized test on production traffic, 72.9% of users gained at least one new personal skill with autonomous skill configuration. In the control group, only 6.5% added one manually. https://t.co/V8dphJ76ai"
