      },
      "text":"Verification depends on whether a change reaches everyone or one user.\n\nA built-in revision must pass every test scenario, the original must fail at least one, and an engineer must approve it.\n\nPersonal skill proposals pass deterministic checks, and an LLM judge audits a sample. https://t.co/aDmfxWogag"
